{"steam_appid":4026250,"steam_name":"Project P.I.T.T.","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4026250/91098790/e02ee87bfe29c16b83fcf1a7e29da6887d76824c/1787150735/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1787151587","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257403219/3cb30f65304b9f8f7edbe5e101e6c615d69fbc30/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1787151587","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/2a04fccf2f4cdeb49619d46715edc7400f2581b7/ss_2a04fccf2f4cdeb49619d46715edc7400f2581b7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787223275","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/a372c277e878f96539d497fa399abb652fac8753/ss_a372c277e878f96539d497fa399abb652fac8753.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787223275","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/eb49ad615260d928c5ca4b065b0e2adaae2ed06b/ss_eb49ad615260d928c5ca4b065b0e2adaae2ed06b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787223275","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/d6fdc10c58d1c6c3daafe6e1d253f3a4ccdd2adf/ss_d6fdc10c58d1c6c3daafe6e1d253f3a4ccdd2adf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787223275","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/82a69af74c5520205759f865e32513dff61ba43e/ss_82a69af74c5520205759f865e32513dff61ba43e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787223275"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/80b7fee61af5172df54898afd35c34e3.avif?t=1787223275\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras_big/80b7fee61af5172df54898afd35c34e3.webp?t=1787223275 width=1560 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new intern at a company with a very simple task. Craft rubber ducks and feed them to the pit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/4ff7c1e3614b746098be7e89e4f1cd3a.poster.avif?t=1787223275\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/4ff7c1e3614b746098be7e89e4f1cd3a.webm?t=1787223275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/4ff7c1e3614b746098be7e89e4f1cd3a.mp4?t=1787223275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/9ff5955fb194b1e959e83d98c45335e9.avif?t=1787223275\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras_big/9ff5955fb194b1e959e83d98c45335e9.webp?t=1787223275 width=1560 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the center of the facility waits the Maw – a vast corporate hole with an appetite that only grows larger the more you feed it. Make ducks, throw them in, earn your place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/f97d89ad0a39ca588ffd9f1b80276268.poster.avif?t=1787223275\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/f97d89ad0a39ca588ffd9f1b80276268.webm?t=1787223275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/f97d89ad0a39ca588ffd9f1b80276268.mp4?t=1787223275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/e2252dc1eac3852d08681be5213a1669.avif?t=1787223275\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras_big/e2252dc1eac3852d08681be5213a1669.webp?t=1787223275 width=1560 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The company is watching. The pit is growing. Ducks will not be enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tools, produce stranger objects, improve your workflow, and build increasingly chaotic physics-based systems to keep up with demand. With each phase, the Maw expands, the facility shifts, and your responsibilities become harder to explain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/a219b9932e4e2b1eaa41435280251d4b.poster.avif?t=1787223275\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/a219b9932e4e2b1eaa41435280251d4b.webm?t=1787223275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/a219b9932e4e2b1eaa41435280251d4b.mp4?t=1787223275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/f715eefb80a07c92ed593154386e62ea.avif?t=1787223275\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras_big/f715eefb80a07c92ed593154386e62ea.webp?t=1787223275 width=1560 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, simple production turns into assembly. Objects begin to connect in unexpected ways. Your work stops feeling like a job. Where are you? Who’s your employer? Why are you doing all this?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/70d475be4f2202802e792ff26111edcd.poster.avif?t=1787223275\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/70d475be4f2202802e792ff26111edcd.webm?t=1787223275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026250/extras/70d475be4f2202802e792ff26111edcd.mp4?t=1787223275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build absurd physics-based production lines and feed products to the Maw</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with rubber ducks, then unlock stranger products, tools, and automation systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use magnets, fans, panels, pistons, launchers, and more to optimize production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain combos and improve throughput for higher payouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the Maw grow larger as production escalates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a brutalist PSX-style corporate facility</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 750 Ti / RX 460</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 / RX 580</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Froke"],"publishers":["Pretty Soon"],"release_date":"Aug 19, 2026"}